/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (You will start with an ESP32-C6, an OLED display, and a laptop, and finish with a small desktop companion that watches what you are doing on the computer and changes its expression accordingly. It can recognise when you are browsing, typing, listening to music, or gaming. You can also control it directly through the Arduino Serial Monitor and ask it to show the weather, display the time, tell a joke, or change its mood.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
